[style name="our style"]
join renko leftmost
renko: Hey, stick closer to me, it’s getting darker for some reason.
join merry rightmost
merry: Is something wrong with flashlight?
renko: No, it’s not. It’s just…ugh. What the hell?
renko: It’s like the light just isn’t going anywhere. I can’t even see an inch in front of me.
merry: That’s…quite odd.
renko: Yeah, I wonder if that thing making those noises is causing this too…
renko: I have a bad feeling. We should get a move on, it might have spotted us.
merry: Let’s…
…
…
renko: It’s getting a bit easier to see now. That was so weird, almost like we were in some kind of fog.
…
renko: Merry, you good? You’ve been quiet for a while.
…
renko: Merry? Huh?!
leave merry
renko: She’s…she’s gone?
renko: When did she? Where did she? Did she fall?
renko: No, I don’t see her. And I would have heard her if she did.
renko: Dammit, did that youkai grab her?! How could that even happen without me knowing. We were basically holding hands the whole time.
renko: …
renko: Maybe, maybe she’s up ahead? But that doesn’t make any sense either! UGH! Whatever! Standing round here is pointless.
renko: I have to keep moving, I…I have to find her.